      "id": "AWS-FH-02",
      "title": "Firehose batching: each PutRecordBatch carries exactly BatchSize records - the default 10 and a configured 25 - and every record of a multi-record request is read back",
      "tier": "aws",
      "priority": "P1",
      "intent": "Batching is the Firehose target's only lever on request rate and cost. Records are flushed when BatchSize are buffered (AwsKinesisFirehoseTargetWriter.kt:167); the only other trigger is the 4 MiB request limit (:155-158, :377). There is no Interval and no timer, so a partial batch waits for the BatchSize-th record (and is lost when sfc-main stops) - which is what makes Messages/Writes exact here. FhDefault leaves BatchSize out and must get the documented default of 10 (AwsKinesisFirehoseTargetConfiguration.kt:108, docs/targets/aws-kinesis-firehose.md:40-45); FhBatch sets 25, which must be honoured (BatchSize is only clamped at 500, :56, :107). Each target has its own schedule and source, so the records read back are told apart by schedule name, and every record of a 10- and a 25-record request must come out of the delivered objects. The case fails if batching is off (ratio 1), if the default or the configured BatchSize is not applied (10 vs 25), if a batch is split or padded, or if records of a multi-record request are lost or duplicated.",
      "pins": [
        "targets/aws-kinesis-firehose-target/src/main/kotlin/com/amazonaws/sfc/awsfirehose/AwsKinesisFirehoseTargetWriter.kt:155-169",
        "targets/aws-kinesis-firehose-target/src/main/kotlin/com/amazonaws/sfc/awsfirehose/AwsKinesisFirehoseTargetWriter.kt:261-262",
        "targets/aws-kinesis-firehose-target/src/main/kotlin/com/amazonaws/sfc/awsfirehose/AwsKinesisFirehoseTargetWriter.kt:284-288",
        "targets/aws-kinesis-firehose-target/src/main/kotlin/com/amazonaws/sfc/awsfirehose/config/AwsKinesisFirehoseTargetConfiguration.kt:49-56",
        "targets/aws-kinesis-firehose-target/src/main/kotlin/com/amazonaws/sfc/awsfirehose/config/AwsKinesisFirehoseTargetConfiguration.kt:107-108",
        "docs/targets/aws-kinesis-firehose.md:40-45"
      ],
      "sinks": {
        "main": {
          "kind": "firehose"
        }
      },
      "gate": {
        "sink": "main",
        "records": 105,
        "timeoutSeconds": 180
      },
      "timeoutSeconds": 90,
      "offlineSeconds": 25,
      "steps": [
        {
          "wait": {
            "metric": {
              "source": "FhDefault",
              "name": "Writes",
              "op": "ge",
              "value": 3
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "wait": {
            "metric": {
              "source": "FhBatch",
              "name": "Writes",
              "op": "ge",
              "value": 3
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "assert": [
        {
          "kind": "recordCount",
          "where": {
            "schedule": "D"
          },
          "min": 30
        },
        {
          "kind": "recordCount",
          "where": {
            "schedule": "B"
          },
          "min": 75
        },
        {
          "kind": "channelValueRun",
          "where": {
            "schedule": "D"
          },
          "source": "simD",
          "channel": "ctr"
        },
        {
          "kind": "channelValueRun",
          "where": {
            "schedule": "B"
          },
          "source": "simB",
          "channel": "ctr"
        },
        {
          "kind": "metricRatio",
          "numerator": {
            "source": "FhDefault",
            "name": "Messages"
          },
          "denominator": {
            "source": "FhDefault",
            "name": "Writes"
          },
          "op": "eq",
          "value": 10,
          "comment": "no BatchSize configured: the default of 10"
        },
        {
          "kind": "metricRatio",
          "numerator": {
            "source": "FhBatch",
            "name": "Messages"
          },
          "denominator": {
            "source": "FhBatch",
            "name": "Writes"
          },
          "op": "eq",
          "value": 25,
          "comment": "BatchSize 25, not the default and not capped at 10"
        },
        {
          "kind": "logAbsent",
          "texts": [
            "Error sending to kinesis firehose delivery stream",
            "Error sending target data"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "config": {
